a point annotation or point shape. For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, you could use a point shape to represent a city at low zoom levels, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"address at high zoom levels, or the location of a long press gesture.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/objc(cs)NSObject":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/objc(cs)NSObject","title":"NSObject","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll: the inner island would be one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object, while the surrounding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group of disconnected but related buildings.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNMultiPolygon","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPolygon","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolylineFeature":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolylineFeature","isActive":